{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550060/extras/About.png?t=1744320321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minesweeper is back, but this time it's together! Minesweeper Together is a logical puzzle board game about revealing cells and avoiding mines cooperatively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550060/extras/Mechanics.png?t=1744320321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you reveal cells, you will find numbers that indicate how many mines are surrounding those numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 5 different difficulties:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Medium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Insane</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diabolical</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The selected difficulty dictates board width, board height, and mine count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you're in the game with up to 3 friends (4 total players), you can all interact with the board and work together to\u00a0reveal cells and flag mines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come play Minesweeper, Together!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550060?t=1744320321","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550060?t=1744320321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550060/823f0698aba5526ce1d132c08b6a0984e86ba9cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744320321","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550060/823f0698aba5526ce1d132c08b6a0984e86ba9cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744320321","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550060/extras/About.png?t=1744320321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minesweeper is back, but this time it's together! Minesweeper Together is a logical puzzle board game about revealing cells and avoiding mines cooperatively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550060/extras/Mechanics.png?t=1744320321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you reveal cells, you will find numbers that indicate how many mines are surrounding those numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 5 different difficulties:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Medium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Insane</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diabolical</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The selected difficulty dictates board width, board height, and mine count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you're in the game with up to 3 friends (4 total players), you can all interact with the board and work together to\u00a0reveal cells and flag mines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come play Minesweeper, Together!</p>","developers":["anchikai"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550060/9f366ef866212b445fb08c6c2e249a3e9ef4d530/header.jpg?t=1744320321","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul clas